{"id":6460,"date":"2026-09-02T10:30:00","date_gmt":"2026-09-02T09:30:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=6460"},"modified":"2026-08-19T11:39:57","modified_gmt":"2026-08-19T10:39:57","slug":"build-a-website-yourself-or-outsource-it-heres-the-best-choice-for-your-business","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/build-a-website-yourself-or-outsource-it-heres-the-best-choice-for-your-business\/","title":{"rendered":"Build a Website Yourself or Outsource It? Here\u2019s the Best Choice for Your Business"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You\u2019d like to have a website for your business, but that quickly raises the following question: Should you build the website yourself or outsource it? Both options have their advantages. The best choice depends on your budget, the time you have available, and what you want to achieve with your website.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">One thing is certain: creating a professional website doesn&#8217;t have to be complicated at all these days! Thanks to our user-friendly editor, you can create a professional-looking website even without any technical knowledge.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this blog post, we&#8217;ll outline the pros and cons of both options so you can make the choice that best suits your business.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When is it a good idea to build a website yourself?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For most aspiring entrepreneurs, building a website on their own is the most logical choice. Why? Because you can get online quickly, the investment is minimal, and you have full control over your website.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whereas in the past you needed a lot of programming knowledge, these days you can use AI to create fully functional websites. Based on just a few questions, AI generates a complete website within minutes, including a suitable design, page layout, and sample text. You can then customize and personalize the website however you like.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Curious about Webador&#8217;s AI Tool? In this video, we&#8217;ll show you how to use our AI Tool:<\/strong><br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"How to: AI Tools in the Webador Editor | Webador\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/-tYUfMqF_z0?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Benefits of Building Your Own Website<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1.You&#8217;ll save money<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Building a website can easily cost hundreds to thousands of euros\u2014especially if you want to update it frequently. By building your own website, you can save that budget for other investments, such as marketing, photography, or purchasing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. <strong>You can make changes right away<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Want to add a new product? Post a new discount on your homepage? Or update your business hours? If you own your website, you don\u2019t have to wait for your web designer. You can easily make all the changes yourself whenever it\u2019s convenient for you.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. You&#8217;ll get to know your own website<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By building your own website, you&#8217;ll discover how your online business card works. You&#8217;ll learn how pages are structured and how to optimize your content for Google. That knowledge will come in handy later when you want to expand your website further.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What should you keep in mind when building a website yourself?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Building a website yourself is easy, but a good website does require a structured foundation. Consider the following:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Choosing a clear domain name: <\/strong>A short and memorable domain name makes it easier for customers to remember your website.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>A professional look: <\/strong>Use no more than 3 colors, clear fonts, and high-quality images.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Write from the customer&#8217;s perspective:<\/strong> Don&#8217;t just explain what you do, focus on how you help your customers. Answer frequently asked questions on your website and clearly explain why someone should choose your company.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>SEO<\/strong>: Don&#8217;t forget your <a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/categories\/29387178511377-Search-Engine-Optimization\">SEO settings<\/a>. With Webador, you can easily set these up yourself. Use relevant keywords, write clear page titles, and add a meta description to each page.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When is outsourcing a good choice?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Although many aspiring entrepreneurs are perfectly capable of building their own websites, there are also situations in which it makes sense to have a website built for you. This is the case, for example, when you need a complex website with specific features. Think of advanced animations, a customer portal, or integrations with external software that aren\u2019t available as standard.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:35px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What should you keep in mind when having a website built?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It\u2019s important to think ahead about what having a website built will mean for you in the long run. For many changes, you\u2019ll be dependent on the company that built your website. In addition, a custom-built website is less flexible than you might think. You initially pay for the design and development, but costs may arise afterward for maintenance, technical updates, or new features.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For most aspiring entrepreneurs, it\u2019s therefore not necessary to hire a professional in the early stages. A website you can manage yourself often offers everything you need to successfully start a business.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As your business grows, you can always expand your website further or choose to hire a professional!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Do it yourself and get professional help? That&#8217;s possible, too!<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Not sure if you have enough knowledge to build a website on your own? Don\u2019t worry: you don\u2019t have to figure it all out by yourself. With <a href=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/\">Webador<\/a>, you can easily build a professional website on your own. In our <a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\">comprehensive help center<\/a>, you\u2019ll find plenty of articles and step-by-step guides on everything related to your website\u2014from choosing a domain name and optimizing SEO to setting up your online store